
<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>
<head>
    <title>Schedule Interview</title>
</head>
<body>

```
<h1>Schedule Interview</h1>

<h2>Candidate</h2>

<p>
    Name:
    <%= application.candidate.name %>
</p>

<p>
    Email:
    <%= application.candidate.email %>
</p>

<h2>Job</h2>

<p>
    Position:
    <%= application.job.title %>
</p>

<form
    action="/schedule-interview/<%= application._id %>"
    method="POST"
>

    <label for="scheduledAt">
        Interview Date and Time
    </label>

    <br>

    <input
        type="datetime-local"
        id="scheduledAt"
        name="scheduledAt"
        required
    >

    <br><br>

    <button type="submit">
        Schedule Interview
    </button>

</form>

<br>

<a href="/jobs/<%= application.job._id %>/applicants">
    Back to Applicants
</a>
```

</body>
</html>
